---
import { metricGroups } from '../../data/portfolio.js';
---
<section class="slide metrics-slide" id="metrics" data-section>
  <div class="slide-inner metrics-layout">
    <aside class="metrics-principle"><div class="eyebrow light"><i></i>PRODUCT METRICS</div><h2>Measure the product, <span>not just the release.</span></h2><p>Metrics connect activity to adoption, efficiency, quality, control and business impact across the product lifecycle.</p><div class="metric-flow"><span>Users</span><i>→</i><span>Behavior</span><i>→</i><span>Efficiency</span><i>→</i><span>Business Impact</span></div><div class="north-star">✦ <b>North-star metric</b><small>One measurable outcome that reflects customer and business value.</small></div></aside>
    <div class="metric-categories">{metricGroups.map(([title,q,sub],i) => <article class={`metric-category m${i+1}`}><b>0{i+1}</b><h3>{title}</h3><p>{q}</p><span>{sub}</span></article>)}</div>
    <aside class="metric-results"><div class="stat-grid"><div><strong>78%</strong><span>User Adoption</span></div><div><strong>62%</strong><span>Activation Rate</span></div><div><strong>45%</strong><span>Effort Reduction</span></div><div><strong>90%</strong><span>Process Accuracy</span></div><div><strong>68%</strong><span>STP Rate</span></div><div><strong>32%</strong><span>Cost Reduction</span></div></div><div class="formula-card"><b>Measurement examples</b><span>Adoption rate = active eligible users ÷ total eligible users × 100</span><span>Activation rate = users reaching first value ÷ new users × 100</span><span>Efficiency gain = (baseline effort − current effort) ÷ baseline effort × 100</span></div><div class="metric-legend"><b>Category</b><b>What I measure</b><span>Adoption</span><span>Users · activation · engagement</span><span>Efficiency</span><span>Time · effort · productivity</span><span>Risk</span><span>Errors · controls · audit</span><span>Business</span><span>Cost · growth · customer value</span></div></aside>
  </div>
</section>
